  "question": {
    "text": "For the given first order reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;the half life of the reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3010</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math>. The ratio of the initial concentration of reactant to the concentration of reactant at time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math> will be equal to _____.&nbsp;(Nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "100",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;is a first order reaction&nbsp;</p><p>and&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3010</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;at time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>=</mo></math>?</p><p>We know the integrated rate equation for first order reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>693</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3010</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
